        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-29T13:54:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, just to be clear, you would apply Superhuman Durability (or Undaunted or Punish the Weak) in step 8?&nbsp; Presumably again in turn order as you said with 4?</p><p>Also, if you apply a redirect in step 4, do you start over checking for other redirects?&nbsp; (That is, if Wraith comes after Visionary and Smoke Bombs redirects the damage to Visionary, would you then apply the Decoy Projection redirect?)&nbsp; And if you do start over, how do you resolve a Smoke Bombs/Decoy Projection loop?</p><p>And do you&nbsp;apply damage type changes in play order (official ruling) or play order as you said with step 4?</p><p>I like these steps as a house rule.&nbsp; Seems like&nbsp;they will handle card interactions in a fairly predictable way.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:31:41.918Z",
