      {
        "id": 56615,
        "name": "pwatson1974",
        "username": "pwatson1974",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-29T17:15:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can't remember exactly when I apply Meteor Swarm. It may be in step 6 and I got confused with another card.</p><p>I use nemesis after target because it depends on the target adn so I want o make sure the target is a'correct' before I apply the nemesis bonus rather than trying to apply and then deapply the bonus.</p><p>By start again, I mean remove all modifiers and start the whole process from scratch, so the bonus is only ever applied once.</p><p>Both Decoy Projection and Smoke Bombs use the whole \"Whenever dealt damage\" but it's easier to put all the redirects that don't need to calculate damage numbers in the same place. If they're not being dealt damage, there won't be a problem with redirecting anyway.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:31:42.155Z",
